### 📁 Files That Need Editing

#### 1. Database (`database/schema.sql`)
- Add new tables:
  - `student_profile` – stores DOB, Age, Height, Weight, Club, Favourite Colour, Admission No
  - `attendance` – stores days opened, present, absent per session/term
  - `affective_domain` – stores 5-point ratings per trait
  - `psychomotor_domain` – stores 5-point ratings per trait
  - `report_remarks` – stores teacher/principal remarks, names, next term date
- Modify `results` table to include `ca1`, `ca2`, `exam`, `total`, `grade`

#### 2. Models (`models/`)
- `Student.js` – Add methods for profile data
- `Result.js` – Update to handle CA1, CA2, Exam, Total, Grade
- `Attendance.js` – New model
- `Affective.js` – New model
- `Psychomotor.js` – New model
- `ReportRemark.js` – New model

#### 3. Services (`services/`)
- `ReportService.js` – New service to orchestrate full report card operations
  - `getFullReport(studentId, session, term)` – Fetch all data
  - `saveFullReport(data)` – Save all sections at once

#### 4. Controllers (`controllers/`)
- `ReportController.js` – New controller
  - `GET /api/report/:studentId` – Get full report card
  - `PUT /api/report` – Save full report card

#### 5. Routes (`routes/`)
- `reportRoutes.js` – New routes for report card operations

#### 6. Frontend – Results Page (`views/results.html`)
- **Redesign:** Student list view with "View Report" button
- **Report Card Modal:** Full editable report card with all sections

#### 7. Frontend – Students Page (`views/students.html`)
- **Add new fields:** DOB, Age, Height, Weight, Club/Society, Favourite Colour

#### 8. CSS (`public/css/`)
- `results.css` – New styles for student list + report card modal
- `students.css` – Updated with new profile fields

#### 9. JavaScript (`public/js/`)
- `results.js` – Complete rewrite for student list + report card
- `students.js` – Updated for new profile fields

#### 10. Public Result Viewing (`views/view-result.html`)
- **Redesign:** Use the same report card design but **read-only** (no edit buttons)


